  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Niue Budget Preparation Assistance 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the lead-up to Government of Niue&apos;s 2024/25 national budget, MFAT&#xA0;will provide technical assistance to support the Government of Niue, in the form of budget formulation and expenditure prioritisation. This support will&#xA0;be a fly-in-fly-out model to ensure appropriate engagement with&#xA0;Government of Niue on the ground.</narrative>
  </description>
